// QuestieDB (GPLv3), another author's addon Ordaen Quests reads the world's quests from: its public API, as the
// globals it makes. It is called from the player's own install; nothing of its code or data is copied here.

// Its public API.
public module LibQuestieDB {
  // Whether its data answers to contract `n` (it holds a range of them), and where not, its own message.
  public function RequireContract(n: Integer): (Boolean, String | nil)
}
